coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder exit-node list [flags]

  List exit nodes in an organization

  Aliases: ls

OPTIONS:
  -O, --org string, $CODER_ORGANIZATION
          Select which organization (uuid or name) to use.

  -c, --column [id|organization id|name|display name|created at|updated at|status|policy mismatch|live replicas] (default: name,display name,status,live replicas,policy mismatch)
          Columns to display in table output.

  -o, --output table|json (default: table)
          Output format.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
